{"_id":"6ab968983767cfc0693d1c1a","title":"VEIL |  - Silent Aim, ESP, Anti Katana 2026","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d59","gameId":17625359962,"name":"[🎃] RIVALS","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c63f148d9f47d6f6e8544ab6423e581017e150ada16e8954529cdfbe5e45467f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b2b718b190726ac0e498f3fd3afc30d9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"17625359962-rivals","path":"/game/17625359962-rivals","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c63f148d9f47d6f6e8544ab6423e581017e150ada16e8954529cdfbe5e45467f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b2b718b190726ac0e498f3fd3afc30d9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":17625359962},"slug":"RIVALS-VEIL-or-Silent-Aim-ESP-Anti-Katana-2026-230252","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":8943,"executes":30425,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c281681e063fa1e58d164e9ef56eda482ead95e390f257c7a1dcfbd49240eefd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17625359962-1791832578581.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17625359962-1791832578581.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c281681e063fa1e58d164e9ef56eda482ead95e390f257c7a1dcfbd49240eefd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17625359962-1791832578581.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17625359962-1791832578581.png"},"likeCount":11,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-27T19:03:52.731Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T19:03:52.731Z","lastBump":"2026-09-27T19:03:52.731Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/david2131233334/Veil/refs/heads/main/obfuscated.lua\"))()","features":"VEIL — Features\n\nSilent Aim — Redirects outgoing rays to your locked target. Hit chance slider, FOV control, Head/UpperTorso/Chest/Random targeting. Requires executor with namecall hook support.\n\nAimbot — Camera-based target lock with adjustable smoothing curve from snap to glide. FOV priority, weapon profiles (AR/Sniper/SMG/Shotgun/Pistol auto-detect), rotate-character toggle, always-on mode.\n\nAim Lock — Harder aim assist, no mouse override while locked. Tighter curve than standard aimbot.\n\nRagebot — Snap aim, no visible check, max FOV. For when you want it obvious.\n\nESP — Boxes, names, health bars, distance, skeleton bones. Full RGB color picker for boxes, names, and skeleton. Adjustable render distance and FPS-scaled update rate.\n\nESP Target Visibility — Colors box green when target is visible, red when occluded behind cover.\n\nViewmodel Chams — Neon material on your held weapon. Optional visibility coloring tied to lock target.\n\nTriggerbot — Auto-fire on raycast hit. Adjustable delay, max distance, proximity fallback for close targets, visible check.\n\nNo Recoil — Zeroes camera kick, stops recoil animation tracks, neutralizes tool recoil values. Three-part suppression.\n\nAnti Flash — Live sweep + instant gate on flash/blind effects in Lighting, PlayerGui, and Workspace. Catches flashes that re-enable on existing instances.\n\nAnti Katana Deflect — Auto-disables your tool when a katana/parry target is locked, re-enables when safe. Prevents self-counter.\n\nHitbox Expander — Scales Head/Torso/Root hitboxes on all players. Adjustable size multiplier.\n\nRapid Fire — Minimum fire delay override. Triggerbot integration.\n\nMax Accuracy / No Spread — Bullet speed set to max, spread zeroed, prediction tightened.\n\nSpinbot — Body gyro rotation while not locked. HvH-flavored.\n\nFly — BodyVelocity movement with WASD + Space/Ctrl. Shift for 2x speed. Weapon-lock option. PC only.\n\nSpeed Hack — WalkSpeed override with BodyVelocity assist for consistent motion across slopes.\n\nInfinite Jump — Space re-triggers jump state while held or recently tapped.\n\nFly Noclip — CanCollide disabled on all character parts while flying.\n\nNight Vision — Ambient boost, shadow disable, green ColorCorrection overlay. Toggleable.\n\nSky Changer — Replaces Lighting Sky with a custom skybox.\n\nCustom Crosshair — Clean 4-arm crosshair with outline and center dot. Replaces default.\n\nHit Sounds — Audio feedback on confirmed hits. Five options: Vine Boom, Mega Knight, MLG Airhorn, Boom Headshot, Taco Bell.\n\nFPS Boost — Culls particles, beams, lights, disables GlobalShadows, quality to Level01, kills post-FX. Big frame gains in crowded fights.\n\nConfig Save/Load — Every setting persists to disk. Weapon profiles save smoothing, FOV, prediction, lead, bullet speed.\n\nFull UI — Tabbed interface: Visuals, Combat, Silent, Trigger, Mods, Config. Draggable, bind-toggleable.\n\nKey System — 24h free tier, premium tiers (1 week / 1 month / 3 months). Redeem in-game under Config → Premium Key.\n\nWorks On — PC (Windows), Mobile (Android/iOS executors), Emulators (auto-detected, uses PC bindings).","tags":["free roblox rivals script aimbot esp silent aim","rivals silent aim aimbot esp anti katana","roblox rivals script silent aim aimbot esp","rivals aimbot esp silent aim triggerbot no recoil","best rivals script"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/K3vgcVsCsS","keyLink":"https://work.ink/2YDv/key-system","owner":{"_id":"69ad6b6d11afc6c1a5a2bd3c","username":"veilxscripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b374781668c2019296cfcde09e681b8d6119a085db49280b1772785c0f4e5db9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69ad6b6d11afc6c1a5a2bd3c-1789661312150.png"},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"69ad6b6d11afc6c1a5a2bd3c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b374781668c2019296cfcde09e681b8d6119a085db49280b1772785c0f4e5db9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69ad6b6d11afc6c1a5a2bd3c-1789661312150.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"working","pct":100,"conf":0.5,"n":{"w":5,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":5,"detected":false,"key":f